      "ja": "コミックボンボンにて好評連載中の「武者○伝」より、主人公「武ちゃ丸」がパワーアップした「武王頑駄無」がプラモデルで登場。武ちゃ丸から武王頑駄無への変身ギミックを再現しています。また、白鋼牛形態への変形も可能。武王頑駄無の活躍をマンガでお読みください。",
      "en": "From \"Musha○den \", which is currently being serialized in Comic Bonbon, \" Buoh Gundam u \", a powered-up version of the main character \" Buchamaru\", is now available as a plastic model. It reproduces the transformation gimmick from Buchamaru to Buoh Gundam u. It is also possible to transform into Shirokogyu form. Please read the manga about the activities of Muoh Gundam u."
